# This file exists only so the Secrets Gradle Plugin (see app/build.gradle.kts)
# has a defaultPropertiesFileName to fall back to when ".env" is absent.
# Nothing in the app code currently reads any key from here — it's safe to
# leave empty or delete keys you don't use.
#
# If you later wire up an API-backed feature that needs a secret, add it here
# as KEY=value and create a matching ".env" (which is git-ignored) with your
# real value.
